<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON MEN'S SINGLES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON MEN'S SINGLES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Men's singles results at the</p>
<p>Wimbledon tennis championships on Monday (prefix denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Third round</p>
<p>Todd Woodbridge (Australia) beat Alexander Radulescu (Germany)</p>
<p>6-4 6-4 6-4</p>
</text>
